{title: Mujhse Shaadi Karogi}
{artist: Udit Narayan Sonu Nigam}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]kab tak jawani chhu [Dm]paogi [Gm]rani,        [Gm]kab tak jawani chhu [Dm]paogi [Gm]rani
[Gm]Kanwaro ko kitna [Dm]sataogi [Gm]rani,        [Gm]Kabhi to kisi ki du [F]lhaniya banogi
[F]Mujhse shaadi karogi,        [F]Mujhse shaadi [Gm]karogi
[Gm]Jhumka dilaunga [F]kangna dilaunga,        [Dm]Sab kuch mai launga [F]teri [Gm]kasam
[Gm]Chanda churaunga [F]tare bhi launga,        [Dm]Suraj jhukaaunga [F]teri [Gm]kasam
[Gm]Kabhi to meri jaan di [F]wani banogi,        [F]Mujhse shaadi karogi
[F]Mujhse shaadi [Gm]karogi,        [Gm]Mai jab bhi aunga [F]Vapas na jaunga
[Dm]Doli uthaunga [F]teri [Gm]kasam,        [Gm]Sab ko dikhaunga [F]Tuzko churaunga
[Dm]Dulhan banaunga [F]teri [Gm]kasam,        [Gm]Arre kab tak meri jaan
[F]Yun mujhse darrogi,        [F]Mujhse shaadi karogi
[F]Mujhse shaadi [Gm]karogi
